00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.200
Sudah kubilang!

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.640
Dia loyo. Dasar pemalas.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.360
Bagaimana menurutmu?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.480
Agak berlebihan.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.400
Ya.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:24.760
Hal terbaik di gaya hidup baruku?

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.400
