00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:52.760
Kejujuran itu kejam.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.360
Hanya keringkan tangan.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.280
Mengesankan.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:25.040
Selamat bersenang-senang, maksudku di...

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:32.320
Hai, Para Pengguna Setia.
Baru dari Wraith Babes,

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:36.520
gadis terseksi di tempat terpanas.
Pilih...

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:54.920
Dasar bodoh.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.920
Detritus.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:11.600
Maaf.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.480
Selma Telse!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.800
Howie Mandelbrot.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.680
ADA PENALTI JIKA MODA BISU
AKTIFKAN?

