Ayolah!

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.000
Tunggu, ada caranya.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.800
- Jarimu bisa terpotong.
- Percayalah.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:36.680
Pintar.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:41.800
Bing Madsen.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.560
Singkatan dari Bingham.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.880
Abi Khan.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.240
Singkatan dari Abi Khan.

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:52.000
Kau orang baru.
Aku belum pernah melihatmu.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.840
Usiaku baru 21 tahun minggu lalu.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.680
Sebenarnya, aku ingin turun,

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:59.600
